WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.000
Pete: Hi! Are you Anna?

00:03.000 --> 00:07.000
Anna: Yes! Hi there! Are you Pete?

00:07.000 --> 00:09.000
Pete: I am Pete.

00:09.000 --> 00:12.000
Anna: Nice to meet you.

00:12.000 --> 00:18.000
Anna: Let's try that again. I'm Anna. Nice to meet you.

00:18.000 --> 00:23.000
Pete: I'm Pete. Anna — is that A-N-A?

00:23.000 --> 00:26.000
Anna: No. A-N-N-A.

00:26.000 --> 00:30.000
Pete: Well, Anna with two n's — welcome!
